# Migrations are checksummed, and git on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) rewrote
# their LF line endings as CRLF on checkout — changing the bytes of files nobody
# had edited, so the runner reported drift and refused to apply anything. The
# runner now normalizes before hashing, but the files themselves should not be
# rewritten underneath it either.
*.sql  text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf

# Everything else: let git decide, and store LF.
*      text=auto
